xxx..xxx*$$$$$xxxxxxx$Dxxxx..xxx
xx.xxxxxxD$.1..x|*|xD|Dxx...xxxx
xxx..xxxxxx....+*|*xxDxx.x.xxxxx
xxxx.....x....xx|*|xxxx.x.xxxxxx
